 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board gives it a secret public URL (`/:account_slug/public/boards/:key`) that anyone can use to view the board and its published cards without signing in. Columns and cards of a public board can also be opened directly at `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id` and `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number`. Only account administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Publishing an already published board keeps its existing public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including the `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/7Vq6UqXNhkYpDNrp8eJx3ZhE",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. The public URL stops working immediately; publishing the board again generates a new one.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8024b28
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,124 @@
+require "test_helper"
+
+class Boards::PublicationsControllerTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
+  setup do
+    sign_in_as :kevin
+    @board = boards(:writebook)
+  end
+
+  test "create" do
+    assert_difference -> { Board::Publication.count }, +1 do
+      post board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "create as JSON" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+    assert_equal public_board_url(@board.public_key), @response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+  end
+
+  test "create is idempotent" do
+    @board.publish
+    key = @board.public_key
+
+    assert_no_difference -> { Board::Publication.count } do
+      post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    end
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert_equal key, @board.reload.public_key
+  end
+
+  test "create requires admin" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :david
+
+    assert_no_difference -> { Board::Publication.count } do
+      post board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "create as JSON requires admin" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :david
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "create requires access to the board" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :jason
+    board = boards(:private)
+
+    post board_publication_path(board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :not_found
+    assert_not board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "destroy" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    assert_difference -> { Board::Publication.count }, -1 do
+      delete board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "destroy as JSON" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "destroy requires admin" do
+    @board.publish
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :david
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "unpublished board renders publish button in settings for admins" do
+    get edit_board_path(@board)
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert_select "form[action='#{board_publication_path(@board)}']"
+    assert_select "span", text: "Publish this board"
+  end
+
+  test "published board renders public link in settings" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    get edit_board_path(@board)
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert_select "input[value='#{public_board_url(@board.public_key)}']"
+    assert_select "span", text: "Unpublish this board"
+  end
+
+  test "non-admins can't see publish button in settings" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :david
+
+    get edit_board_path(@board)
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert_select "form[action='#{board_publication_path(@board)}']", count: 0
+  end
+end
